    {
      "id": "Oi9idoJqEJqhx71UBlelZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1272.0383744046096,
      "y": 703.7050496839676,
      "width": 872.0198974609375,
      "height": 650,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 188034301,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1698812349,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786348804430,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "[ App Mount ] ──(1) useEffect() ──> restoreSession()\n                                        │\n                                       (2) authService.getProfile()\n                                        │\n                                       (3) request('/auth/profile')\n                                        │\n                                  getStoredToken() ──(4) reads localStorage\n                                        │\n                                        ▼\n                                HTTP Request Header:\n                       \"Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>\"\n                                        │\n                                        ▼\n[ Express Router ] ──(5) GET /profile ──> protect Middleware (`authMiddleware.js`)\n                                                │\n                                         jwt.verify(token)\n                                                │\n                                         User.findById()\n                                                │\n                                         (6) attach req.user & next()\n                                                ▼\n                                         getUserProfile()\n                                                │\n                                         (7) returns req.user\n                                                ▼\n                                   setUser() & setView('dashboard')",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "[ App Mount ] ──(1) useEffect() ──> restoreSession()\n                                        │\n                                       (2) authService.getProfile()\n                                        │\n                                       (3) request('/auth/profile')\n                                        │\n                                  getStoredToken() ──(4) reads localStorage\n                                        │\n                                        ▼\n                                HTTP Request Header:\n                       \"Authorization: Bearer <JWT_TOKEN>\"\n                                        │\n                                        ▼\n[ Express Router ] ──(5) GET /profile ──> protect Middleware (`authMiddleware.js`)\n                                                │\n                                         jwt.verify(token)\n                                                │\n                                         User.findById()\n                                                │\n                                         (6) attach req.user & next()\n                                                ▼\n                                         getUserProfile()\n                                                │\n                                         (7) returns req.user\n                                                ▼\n                                   setUser() & setView('dashboard')",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "0WYldMajWCh_oi0cQ1zii",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2248.9880062334933,
      "y": 768.752031771693,
      "width": 1303.6800537109375,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b08",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1513522365,
      "version": 50,
      "versionNonce": 1796953811,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786348839970,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "useEffect() (App.jsx): Fires automatically when the app mounts on page load. It defines and immediately invokes restoreSession().\nrestoreSession() (App.jsx): Calls authService.getProfile().\nauthService.getProfile() (api.js): Calls request('/auth/profile').\ngetStoredToken() inside request() (api.js):\nReads the token using window.localStorage.getItem('paper_path_token').\nAttaches it to the fetch headers: Authorization: Bearer ${token}.\nprotect Middleware (authMiddleware.js):\nIntercepts the request before it reaches the endpoint controller.\nExtracts the token string from the Bearer  header.\nRuns jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET).\nTakes the decoded user ID and queries MongoDB: User.findById(userId).select('-password').\nnext() (authMiddleware.js): Attaches the database user object to req.user and calls next() to hand execution over to the controller.\ngetUserProfile() (authController.js): Extracts req.user details and returns them as a JSON response.\nrestoreSession() (App.jsx): Receives the profile data, executes setUser(storedProfile), and sets setView('dashboard').",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "useEffect() (App.jsx): Fires automatically when the app mounts on page load. It defines and immediately invokes restoreSession().\nrestoreSession() (App.jsx): Calls authService.getProfile().\nauthService.getProfile() (api.js): Calls request('/auth/profile').\ngetStoredToken() inside request() (api.js):\nReads the token using window.localStorage.getItem('paper_path_token').\nAttaches it to the fetch headers: Authorization: Bearer ${token}.\nprotect Middleware (authMiddleware.js):\nIntercepts the request before it reaches the endpoint controller.\nExtracts the token string from the Bearer  header.\nRuns jwt.verify(token, process.env.JWT_SECRET).\nTakes the decoded user ID and queries MongoDB: User.findById(userId).select('-password').\nnext() (authMiddleware.js): Attaches the database user object to req.user and calls next() to hand execution over to the controller.\ngetUserProfile() (authController.js): Extracts req.user details and returns them as a JSON response.\nrestoreSession() (App.jsx): Receives the profile data, executes setUser(storedProfile), and sets setView('dashboard').",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
